    "version": "1.1.10",
    "title": "Your usage stats choice stays yours.",
    "text": "Installation counting is now separate from optional usage statistics. A fresh installation registers once while its saved app data remains; reopening or a normal reinstall does not add another installation. Existing installations are not counted as fresh.\n\nActive sessions are reported only after you choose to allow usage stats. Choosing No stops new optional activity reports and requests deletion of that history. Earlier opt-outs are preserved.\n\nThe video shows existing caption styling and editing features. This update changes installation and usage reporting.",
